    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A challenging dark fantasy hack &amp; slash where players must cleanse a cursed castle, battle through an enchanted forest, and descend into the underworld to eradicate the undead hordes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Brutal and strategic combat</strong>: Master melee attacks, bow skills, and magic to take on increasingly deadly enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Explore a decaying world</strong>: From the ruins of a besieged castle to the cursed dark forests and the depths of the underworld, each environment presents unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Relentless enemies</strong>: Dodge swift specters, clash with armored warriors, evade deadly traps set by archers, and withstand the dark magic of necromancers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Colossal bosses</strong>: Face the <strong>Lord of Fire</strong>, who scorches everything in his path, and the <strong>Necromancer</strong>, who raises legions of the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Adapt your strategy</strong>: Each level shifts the gameplay, forcing you to use new tactics to survive and purge the kingdom of darkness.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A challenging dark fantasy hack &amp; slash where players must cleanse a cursed castle, battle through an enchanted forest, and descend into the underworld to eradicate the undead hordes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Brutal and strategic combat</strong>: Master melee attacks, bow skills, and magic to take on increasingly deadly enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Explore a decaying world</strong>: From the ruins of a besieged castle to the cursed dark forests and the depths of the underworld, each environment presents unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Relentless enemies</strong>: Dodge swift specters, clash with armored warriors, evade deadly traps set by archers, and withstand the dark magic of necromancers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Colossal bosses</strong>: Face the <strong>Lord of Fire</strong>, who scorches everything in his path, and the <strong>Necromancer</strong>, who raises legions of the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Adapt your strategy</strong>: Each level shifts the gameplay, forcing you to use new tactics to survive and purge the kingdom of darkness.</p>",
